---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Facility & Infrastructure">
  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12 leading-[0.9]">Precision Engineered at Every Stage</h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
        At Rupam Precision Engineering, our commitment to precision and excellence begins with our state-of-the-art infrastructure. We take immense pride in our cutting-edge facilities and machinery, carefully designed to meet the highest standards of precision and quality.
      </p>
      
      <div class="bg-neutral-900 aspect-[21/9] w-full flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-neutral-600 tracking-widest text-sm">[ PLACEHOLDER: FACILITY WIDE SHOT ]</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6 sticky top-32">Advanced CNC and VMC Machinery</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8 text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>Our manufacturing prowess is driven by a formidable fleet of 14 state-of-the-art Computer Numerical Control (CNC) and Vertical Machining Center (VMC) machines, featuring some of the finest brands in the industry. Among them, we proudly house renowned names such as HAAS from the United States and Makino from Japan. The combination of American innovation and Japanese precision is emblematic of our commitment to delivering uncompromising quality.</p>
        <p>These machines represent the very essence of precision engineering, combining cutting-edge technology with exceptional craftsmanship. Each CNC and VMC machine in our arsenal is a masterpiece of precision, capable of transforming raw materials into components of extraordinary accuracy and complexity.</p>
        <p>With our CNC machines, we can craft intricate geometries and achieve tight tolerances that were once considered unattainable. Our VMC machines, on the other hand, provide the versatility to handle a wide range of machining operations, ensuring that we can meet the diverse needs of our clients.</p>
        <p>Whether it's producing components for the aerospace, automotive, medical, or any other industry, our CNC and VMC machines are equipped to deliver excellence at every step of the manufacturing process. These machines, operated by our skilled machinists, are the driving force behind our ability to consistently exceed the most demanding expectations in terms of quality, precision, and efficiency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Comprehensive Measuring Instruments</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">Quality assurance is paramount in our operations. To ensure that every component we produce meets or exceeds industry standards, we have invested in all necessary measuring instruments. Our state-of-the-art equipment includes Coordinate Measuring Machines (CMM), Contracer measuring machines, height gauges, and roughness testers. These instruments play a pivotal role in our rigorous quality control processes, guaranteeing that precision is at the heart of everything we create.</p>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Sheet Metal Product Manufacturing Expertise</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">In addition to our CNC and VMC machines, we have a diverse array of sheet metal product manufacturing machines. These machines enable us to transform raw materials into finely crafted sheet metal components, tailored to your exact specifications. Whether your project involves simple designs or intricate structures, our sheet metal manufacturing capabilities are at your service.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Comprehensive Welding Facilities</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">Welding is a critical aspect of many of our projects, and we are well-prepared for the task. Our facility is equipped with a wide range of welding machines capable of welding various materials with precision and durability. Our skilled welders ensure that every joint is seamless and robust, meeting the stringent requirements of your applications.</p>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">In-House Buffing and Painting Setup</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">The finishing touches to our components are equally important. That's why we maintain an in-house buffing and painting setup. This ensures that the final appearance of your components is as exceptional as their performance. Our meticulous attention to detail extends to every aspect of our operations, leaving no stone unturned in our pursuit of excellence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-32 px-4 md:px-8 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8 leading-none">Experience the difference of precision</h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-400 font-light mb-12">At Rupam Precision Engineering, precision is not just a goal; it's a way of life. Our advanced infrastructure, anchored by our CNC and VMC machines, provides the foundation upon which we build exceptional components. Our commitment to investing in the latest technology and maintaining a skilled workforce ensures that we consistently deliver precision-engineered solutions that exceed your expectations.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="bg-white text-black px-8 py-4 uppercase text-sm font-bold hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors inline-block">Contact Us Today</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
